WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:11.860
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:04.600 --> 00:06.300
We've reached Renri Town!

00:07.340 --> 00:08.910
Wow, awesome!

00:11.880 --> 00:13.600
Look! They're waterfalls, bro!

00:16.000 --> 00:18.660
Renri Town is known as the town of waterfalls.

00:19.290 --> 00:21.660
And as a town where they hold Tripokalons!

00:23.800 --> 00:24.110
That's right.

00:24.840 --> 00:27.160
It's the town where you'll have your debut, Eievui!

00:30.590 --> 00:31.550
The last one...

00:31.950 --> 00:33.660
...we'll get here in Renri Town!

00:37.290 --> 00:43.010
Dance, Eievui!
Its Tripokalon Debut!!

00:44.070 --> 00:46.440
Satoshi and his friends have arrived in Renri Town.

00:47.080 --> 00:51.910
Finally, the Tripokalon that will decide if Serena can enter Master Class is going to begin!

00:52.890 --> 00:54.020
Wow!

00:54.020 --> 01:03.870
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

00:54.020 --> 01:03.870
Z

00:54.020 --> 00:55.190
Awesome!

00:55.420 --> 00:59.060
So this time, the stage uses makes use of waterfalls and their surrounding geographical features.

00:59.350 --> 01:00.940
This is our first open-air stage, huh?

01:07.430 --> 01:09.900
I was really nervous in the beginning, too.

01:10.420 --> 01:11.700
Of course, I still am.

01:12.140 --> 01:14.140
And I'm also very excited!

01:14.650 --> 01:15.000
What about you, Eievui?

01:17.720 --> 01:21.210
Over there, lots of people will watch our performance.

01:21.750 --> 01:22.260
Isn't it pretty?

01:26.420 --> 01:27.260
Let's do this!

01:27.590 --> 01:30.040
Eievui... you'll be dancing during the free performance!

01:39.380 --> 01:40.260
That girl...

01:59.380 --> 02:00.870
So this is the stage.

02:01.320 --> 02:05.240
This time I'll show off my good looks to the fullest and win!

02:05.240 --> 02:10.490
But to participate in the free performance, you need to pass the theme performance first.

02:10.490 --> 02:11.350
He's right.

02:13.220 --> 02:14.600
Leave it to me!

02:38.550 --> 02:39.320
Eievui...

02:46.020 --> 02:48.340
Let's stay like this until you're not nervous any more.

02:48.980 --> 02:50.310
We're all by your side,

02:51.020 --> 02:51.800
so don't worry.

03:07.300 --> 03:10.140
The only tricky part is that theme performance.

03:10.140 --> 03:11.740
As long as I pass that...

03:12.260 --> 03:15.490
So you want to check what the theme will be this time, right?

03:15.880 --> 03:18.890
Exactly. You gotta use your head, you know?

03:18.890 --> 03:20.210
That's my Musashi!

03:20.680 --> 03:22.500
Hm... Which one is it?

03:22.820 --> 03:24.040
Where is it?

03:25.260 --> 03:26.260
This isn't it!

03:28.220 --> 03:28.600
Oh no!

03:28.900 --> 03:29.560
Run!

03:32.480 --> 03:34.780
I think we've run far enough.

03:35.900 --> 03:37.620
I panicked a bit there.

03:37.820 --> 03:39.670
Whose fault was that?!

03:40.040 --> 03:42.200
Huh? What do you have in your hand?

03:42.700 --> 03:45.560
It was lying around nearby, so I just randomly grabbed it and brought it with me.

03:45.560 --> 03:46.900
What's that picture?

03:47.530 --> 03:48.520
Hm?

03:49.210 --> 03:51.260
This must be a hint, don't you think?

03:51.610 --> 03:53.030
What is it?

03:54.460 --> 03:57.540
An Arbo that has swallowed a Manmoo?

03:57.930 --> 04:00.500
It also looks like a UFO.

04:00.500 --> 04:02.870
What kind of performance is <i>that</i> supposed to be?

04:05.210 --> 04:07.250
Could this be a hat for Pokémon?

04:07.590 --> 04:11.630
That's possible! They're going to test your fashion sense.

04:12.040 --> 04:15.430
That must be it. Making hats that look good on Pokémon...

04:17.770 --> 04:19.080
I'm first!

04:22.680 --> 04:23.980
There are lots of people!

04:24.630 --> 04:28.500
Eureka, don't get separated from us! You'll get lost!

04:28.860 --> 04:29.260
Okay!

04:29.850 --> 04:30.990
Serena!

04:31.500 --> 04:32.570
It's been a while!

04:32.980 --> 04:33.830
Nene!

04:33.830 --> 04:35.020
Long time no see!

04:35.020 --> 04:37.580
Hello, Muchul, Kamonegi!

04:44.540 --> 04:46.780
So you got a Gothimu, Nene!

04:47.000 --> 04:47.960
It's our new star.

04:49.400 --> 04:50.950
So cute!

04:51.670 --> 04:53.460
Gothimu, the Fixation Pokémon.

04:53.860 --> 04:57.190
Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power.

04:57.740 --> 05:02.340
When they are intently staring at something, they are looking at something that only Gothimu can see.

05:03.080 --> 05:04.980
So you'll enter this tournament too, Nene?

05:05.320 --> 05:06.170
Of course!

05:06.570 --> 05:09.690
I just need one more Princess Key! I'll clinch it in today's tournament!

05:10.070 --> 05:11.440
I only have one left too.

05:11.940 --> 05:12.810
I won't lose!

05:13.020 --> 05:14.030
Neither will I!

05:15.680 --> 05:17.850
Is this Eievui your new star, Serena?

05:18.780 --> 05:21.240
That's right. It's a very good dancer.

05:21.620 --> 05:22.780
Wow.

05:23.420 --> 05:24.000
What's the matter?

05:24.650 --> 05:28.650
It takes a bit of time for this little one to get used to new people.

05:46.010 --> 05:47.210
Bonjour!

05:47.480 --> 05:50.200
People of Kalos who love Pokémon above all else;

05:50.740 --> 05:57.230
The Renri Tripokalon Rookie Class Tournament, a maidens' festival, will now begin with elegance and splendor!

06:01.800 --> 06:04.330
I'm your guide to your dream of love,

06:04.810 --> 06:06.740
Monsieur Pierre!

06:07.060 --> 06:09.060
Pierre!

06:09.060 --> 06:12.140
In this trés bien battle between those who aim to become Kalos Queen,

06:13.380 --> 06:17.260
the winner will be awarded this Princess Key!

06:18.090 --> 06:19.250
The first stage,

06:19.420 --> 06:22.450
today's theme performance, is...

06:22.950 --> 06:23.860
...this!

06:25.610 --> 06:28.190
All right! Making hats for Pokémon!

06:28.310 --> 06:30.190
We got this one.

06:31.780 --> 06:33.700
"Performing while making Pofflés"!

06:34.390 --> 06:35.700
Faceplant!

06:36.580 --> 06:39.880
I worked until late at night and made 23 hats, and yet...

06:40.330 --> 06:43.080
...it was all for nothing.

06:48.820 --> 06:50.620
If it's Pofflé making she'll be fine.

06:50.900 --> 06:52.860
Yeah, with Serena's Pofflés...

06:53.220 --> 06:55.340
...she is guaranteed to advance to the free performances.

06:56.200 --> 07:00.660
In today's "Performing while making Pofflés", you don't simply bake Pofflés,

07:00.920 --> 07:05.060
but you need to spice up the process with a magnificent and imaginative performance.

07:05.790 --> 07:08.020
The judging is extremely simple.

07:08.390 --> 07:12.570
If you folks think it's trés bien, please vote for it with your PokéLumes.

07:13.110 --> 07:17.320
Performers who acquire a certain number of votes will pass the theme performance.

07:18.390 --> 07:19.660
Let's begin right away!

07:20.170 --> 07:22.920
We'll kick things off with Performer Nene!

07:28.420 --> 07:30.420
Let the Pofflé making start!

07:33.250 --> 07:34.670
Kamonegi, Fury Cutter!

08:06.820 --> 08:08.060
Finish!

08:08.940 --> 08:13.060
Performer Nene has made a cool Pofflé!

08:15.850 --> 08:16.980
Nene is really good!

08:18.510 --> 08:19.640
Those are some plain colors.

08:19.940 --> 08:22.590
Those are the colors gothlolis <i>use</i>...

08:24.870 --> 08:26.600
Harimaron, please calm down!

08:27.290 --> 08:29.260
Now then, dear audience...

08:30.060 --> 08:36.350
If you think Performer Nene's Pofflé Performance was très bien, please raise your PokéLumes!

08:37.290 --> 08:37.650
Go!

08:45.290 --> 08:48.740
Performer Nene has passed the theme performance!

08:49.260 --> 08:50.660
How's that?

08:52.820 --> 08:57.210
All right, enter Performer Musavie next!

09:04.010 --> 09:08.870
Sonansu is sifting flour at full speed and full power. That'll make for an extra fine dough!

09:09.160 --> 09:11.220
Then you add a splash of milk...

09:13.050 --> 09:15.530
Now comes Nyarth's toe beans massage...

09:15.830 --> 09:18.400
...which gives it a unique elasticity!

09:18.760 --> 09:20.440
Yeah! And what comes next?

09:21.080 --> 09:23.860
This is the final touch!

09:29.290 --> 09:30.680
That's amusing!

09:30.680 --> 09:32.580
A Pofflé with a coin pattern, huh?

09:33.220 --> 09:33.500
Here.

09:33.740 --> 09:35.170
Nyarth, Fury Swipes!

09:38.440 --> 09:39.610
Jiggle!

09:40.380 --> 09:40.960
Finish!

09:41.690 --> 09:43.350
Good job, Musavie!

09:43.860 --> 09:46.820
She put her Pokémon's distinctive traits to good use to make that Pofflé.

09:47.190 --> 09:49.110
It looks so tender and tasty!

09:51.000 --> 09:56.810
I will ask Serena to make you a Pofflé later, so please be patient for a while longer.

09:59.880 --> 10:01.190
Oh, you child.

10:01.700 --> 10:03.740
Vote, s'il-vous-plaît!

10:07.900 --> 10:11.800
Performer Musavie has passed the theme performance!

10:12.580 --> 10:13.550
Obviously!

10:15.850 --> 10:18.540
Good job, good job, Musavie!

10:26.810 --> 10:29.670
All right, the last theme performance is by...

10:29.940 --> 10:32.780
...Performer Serena!

10:33.850 --> 10:34.950
It's finally Serena's turn!

10:35.270 --> 10:36.900
Serena, do your best!

10:37.380 --> 10:38.190
Yancham, you too!

10:49.540 --> 10:50.660
Pokémon Quiz!

10:51.000 --> 10:51.830
The answer is...?

11:33.510 --> 11:34.320
Finish!

11:36.530 --> 11:37.810
Good job, Serena!

11:37.310 --> 11:38.400
It looks delicious!

11:38.400 --> 11:40.690
That was very nice and rhythmical!

11:41.940 --> 11:44.050
Please vote!

11:44.310 --> 11:45.390
Serena!

11:53.470 --> 11:56.900
Performer Serena has passed the theme performance!

11:59.310 --> 12:00.610
We did it, Yancham!

12:02.640 --> 12:03.780
That's the spirit.

12:04.190 --> 12:06.750
All theme performances are finished.

12:07.280 --> 12:13.120
The free performances will begin in the evening, so we'll be taking a break until then.

12:17.570 --> 12:18.850
Here's a Pofflé for you.

12:20.320 --> 12:21.760
Thank you very much, Serena.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.670
It's nothing.

12:25.600 --> 12:27.330
You shouldn't gobble it down so fast...

12:27.700 --> 12:28.660
Right, Eievui?

12:29.840 --> 12:31.180
What's the matter, Eievui?

12:33.180 --> 12:34.740
You won't have enough energy if you don't eat.

12:36.430 --> 12:38.440
This little one didn't eat anything this morning either.

12:38.930 --> 12:44.230
In that case, I will make the Pokémon Food easier to eat by mixing it with Obao and Oran Berries.

12:47.970 --> 12:50.000
Thank goodness, it's eating.

12:50.290 --> 12:53.710
You've practiced so much, so all you have to do is dance like you usually do.

13:09.190 --> 13:10.770
I'm sorry for the long wait!

13:11.070 --> 13:16.320
It's finally time for the très bien and love-filled free performances to start.

13:16.990 --> 13:19.620
We'll kick things off with Performer Nene!

13:21.470 --> 13:23.150
Let's go! Powder Snow!

13:27.920 --> 13:28.870
Fury Cutter!

13:38.640 --> 13:40.550
Gothimu, Psychic!

13:47.030 --> 13:48.240
Heart Stamp!

13:51.680 --> 13:52.310
Fury Cutter!

14:00.880 --> 14:02.120
Heartbreaking...

14:06.950 --> 14:08.190
I expected nothing less from Nene.

14:09.040 --> 14:11.160
Serena-san, please stand by.

14:11.760 --> 14:12.160
Okay!

14:12.530 --> 14:14.150
Leech Seed!

14:22.740 --> 14:24.140
Sonansu, Counter!

14:27.890 --> 14:29.550
Olé!

14:32.350 --> 14:34.050
Olé!

14:37.090 --> 14:38.940
Pumpjin, Shadow Ball!

14:44.500 --> 14:45.360
Seed Bomb!

14:53.920 --> 14:55.010
Finish!

14:55.410 --> 14:56.680
All right, that went well!

14:57.250 --> 14:59.830
Good job, good job, Musavie!

15:07.760 --> 15:10.640
All right, Eievui, Tairenar... Are you ready?

15:12.690 --> 15:15.330
Capping off the free performances will be...

15:16.450 --> 15:18.290
...Performer Serena!

15:21.570 --> 15:22.830
It's finally Serena's turn.

15:22.830 --> 15:24.270
If she wins, she'll get her last Key.

15:24.720 --> 15:25.350
Do your best!

15:33.650 --> 15:34.660
Let's go, Eievui!

15:39.570 --> 15:40.310
Tairenar!

16:03.270 --> 16:04.180
Well done!

16:04.180 --> 16:05.710
Eievui, you're so cool!

16:11.060 --> 16:12.150
Flamethrower!

16:49.570 --> 16:50.290
Eievui!

17:03.780 --> 17:04.840
Let's finish this!

17:12.030 --> 17:12.750
Tairenar,

17:13.030 --> 17:13.970
Fire Blast!

17:24.690 --> 17:26.290
Finish!

17:28.580 --> 17:29.940
Awesome, awesome!

17:29.940 --> 17:31.780
That was her greatest performance!

17:32.000 --> 17:32.740
Yes.

17:35.870 --> 17:36.750
Don't worry.

17:37.220 --> 17:41.490
More importantly, what do you think? Did you have fun in your first performance?

17:46.880 --> 17:53.170
Now, please vote by lighting your PokéLumes in the color of the Performer you thought was best.

17:53.940 --> 17:55.220
S'il-vous-plaît!

17:55.620 --> 17:56.470
Go!

17:56.750 --> 17:57.510
Musavie!

18:09.890 --> 18:12.770
All right, the winner has been determined.

18:13.190 --> 18:15.190
The one to obtain the Princess Key...

18:15.630 --> 18:17.970
...is you, Performer Musavie!

18:18.270 --> 18:19.890
Huh? Me?

18:21.330 --> 18:23.500
Y-You finally did it...

18:27.760 --> 18:30.050
All right!

18:31.430 --> 18:35.790
The winner, Performer Musavie, will now be given this Princess Key.

18:39.190 --> 18:42.480
All right, all right, all right! I finally got one!

18:44.110 --> 18:48.350
With that, the Renri Tripokalon Rookie Class Tournament is finished!

18:48.630 --> 18:51.550
Au revoir!

18:54.180 --> 18:55.220
You did it, Musashi!

18:55.220 --> 18:59.280
That Princess Key is the fruit of your tears, sweat and efforts!

18:59.600 --> 19:02.370
I might as well be declared Kalos Queen already.

19:02.560 --> 19:06.660
I was hearing sighs of admiration for my beauty coming from the audience.

19:10.510 --> 19:12.530
I can see the path to Kalos Queen;

19:12.770 --> 19:14.110
I can see it clearly!

19:14.930 --> 19:18.000
Both girls from Kalos who aim to participate in Tripokalon...

19:18.850 --> 19:20.370
...as well as the men of Kalos...

19:20.640 --> 19:22.850
...are intoxicated by my beauty,

19:23.310 --> 19:24.420
fall to their knees...

19:24.690 --> 19:26.560
...and prostrate themselves before me!

19:32.870 --> 19:34.270
It's hilarious!

19:36.750 --> 19:38.990
Nene, our last Keys will have to wait a bit longer.

19:39.620 --> 19:40.860
Yeah, I'll do my best!

19:41.310 --> 19:43.120
Eievui, cheer up.

19:43.570 --> 19:45.410
Considering it was your debut, you did a good job!

19:48.410 --> 19:48.990
Eievui.

19:49.550 --> 19:51.630
What's most important that you don't give up after a mistake.

19:52.310 --> 19:53.750
Brooding over it won't do anything.

19:56.420 --> 19:57.920
They're saying they'll help you!

20:01.200 --> 20:04.070
Let's do our best at the next Tripokalon, Eievui!

20:06.960 --> 20:11.670
Serena had to put off her third Princess Key, but she and her Pokémon's challenge is...

20:16.000 --> 20:20.970
Sunday December 20th at 8am!

20:16.560 --> 20:20.970
Celebrities appear!

20:16.820 --> 20:18.420
Pikachu and Pistachio appear!

20:19.030 --> 20:20.260
On Sunday at 8am!

20:21.010 --> 20:25.030
Professor Okido

20:21.030 --> 20:25.030
The latest movie news!

20:21.500 --> 20:22.700
The latest movie news!

20:22.870 --> 20:24.670
Let's start with this top secret footage!

20:25.110 --> 20:27.160
Based on the creations of
Satoshi Tajiri

20:27.780 --> 20:29.830
Directed by
Kunihiko Yuyama

20:29.050 --> 20:30.430
The newest installment of the series!

20:31.290 --> 20:35.100
The hottest legend in Pokémon history will finally begin!

20:52.600 --> 20:55.050
Premieres Saturday July 16th!

20:55.560 --> 20:58.450
Incredibly, a mythical Pokémon has been discovered!

20:58.450 --> 21:05.280
Volcanion

20:58.450 --> 21:05.280
Species: Steam Pokémon

20:58.450 --> 21:05.280
Type: Fire/Water

20:58.450 --> 21:05.280
Height: 1.7m

20:58.450 --> 21:05.280
Weight: 195.0kg

20:58.450 --> 21:05.280
Ability: Water Absorb

20:58.890 --> 21:00.590
Its name is Volcanion.

21:01.150 --> 21:04.840
It has two conflicting types, Fire and Water.

21:05.870 --> 21:10.550
The moves it launches from its arms have enough power to gouge out the earth and change the shape of the land.

21:11.210 --> 21:14.890
Wait for more info to see what role it'll play in the movie!

21:18.120 --> 21:19.990
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:20.250 --> 21:21.310
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.510 --> 21:23.460
Squishy, we're here!

21:23.850 --> 21:25.420
This is Terminus Cave.

21:27.250 --> 21:30.170
Squishy, where are you going? Wait!

21:30.850 --> 21:31.790
Capture Z1!

21:32.120 --> 21:35.480
I've been waiting for you. This time I'll get you, Z-chan!

21:35.960 --> 21:38.730
Next time on Pocket Monsters XY&Z:

21:39.080 --> 21:42.270
Terminus Cave! The Mystery of Z is Set in Motion!!

21:42.440 --> 21:45.930
Next Time

21:42.440 --> 21:45.930
Terminus Cave!
The Mystery of Z is Set in Motion!!

21:42.970 --> 21:44.950
Everyone, get Pokémon!

21:45.970 --> 21:55.940
Next episode:

21:45.970 --> 21:50.900
Squishy has vanished!?

21:46.760 --> 21:51.390
Pocket Monsters XY&Z was brought to you by these sponsors.

21:50.940 --> 21:55.940
The evil hands of the Flare Gang approach!
